# Gamepad and feel

Gamepad is mandatory. Keyboard/mouse is not skating.

- Poll `navigator.getGamepads()` on load and every play frame.
- Need a pad with two analog sticks. Missing → full-screen overlay, not dismissible until a valid pad is back.
- Overlay copy: CONTROLLER REQUIRED / Connect a gamepad with two analog sticks / dual-stick foot-control / Keyboard is not supported for skating.
- After a pad is seen, require “Press any button to start” before play.
- Disconnect mid-session → pause physics, show overlay, resume only when reconnected.
- Clanker debug bypass lives in `.cursor/rules/clanker.mdc`. Do not delete it while “enforcing” this gate.
- Dual-stick feet: Regular (default) right stick = back foot; Goofy reverses. No stance change mid-air or on a grind (or it bails).
- No magnetic snap to rails. Free-skate v1: no score, timer, or missions.
